            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5197] Livy.sql interpreter fails to execute</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5197</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If `zeppelin.livy.concurrentSQL` is set to false then livy-interpreter fails with following exception:&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
